<section class="px-6 pt-40 pb-28 sm:pt-48">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl reveal">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-5 text-4xl sm:text-5xl">Accessibility Statement</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-espresso-400">Last updated {{ "now" | currentYear }}</p>

    <div class="mt-10 space-y-8 leading-relaxed text-espresso-500">
      <p>Signature Therapeutic Wellness is committed to ensuring this website is accessible to everyone, including people with disabilities.</p>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl text-espresso-700">Our Approach</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">We aim to follow the Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1 Level AA, including semantic HTML, keyboard-navigable menus, sufficient color contrast, and descriptive alt text for images.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl text-espresso-700">Ongoing Improvements</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">Accessibility is an ongoing effort. As we update this site, we review new pages and features for accessibility issues and address them promptly.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h2 class="text-xl text-espresso-700">Feedback</h2>
        <p class="mt-3">If you encounter any barriers using this website, or need assistance accessing information about our services, please contact us — we're happy to help.</p>
        <p class="mt-3">
          <a href="{{ site.phoneHref }}" class="text-sage-600 underline underline-offset-4">{{ site.phone }}</a><br>
          <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" class="text-sage-600 underline underline-offset-4">{{ site.email }}</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
